WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.875
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.000
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.416
spoke about the importance of devotion.

4
00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:36.833
Now in this verse,

5
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:40.958
He addresses an important question.

6
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.291
Can that devotee

7
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:45.916
who sometimes strays from his path,

8
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:48.916
can he too attain liberation?

9
00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:50.875
In Arjun's mind, this curiosity

10
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:54.041
is natural, because in practical life

11
00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:58.000
we all make mistakes at some point.

12
00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.666
Lord Krishna in this verse

13
00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:01.166
describes the transformative

14
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.083
power of devotion

15
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:04.625
and assures us

16
00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:06.916
that devotion done with a true heart

17
00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:09.875
erases all shortcomings.

18
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.666
Lord Krishna

19
00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.750
in this verse first establishes

20
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.458
that a devotee

21
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:22.375
who with exclusive devotion
remains absorbed in Him –

22
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.250
even if he has committed an improper act,

23
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.250
he still quickly becomes righteous

24
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.416
and attains lasting peace.

25
00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:32.250
At first glance,

26
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:36.208
this may seem contradictory, but Lord Krishna

27
00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:39.000
reveals the power of devotion

28
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.208
that purifies the heart and mind.

29
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.583
Such a person

30
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:46.500
is said to be 'established in the right state,'

31
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.916
which means

32
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:50.708
that even after occasional errors,

33
00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:53.583
in worshipping Lord Krishna their resolve

34
00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:55.125
remains unwavering.

35
00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:56.125
Its root

36
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.000
lies in the sincerity of the devotee's heart.

37
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.041
When a devotee recognises
his mistakes and true

38
00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:03.666
repentance feels,

39
00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:08.458
then he naturally becomes
more firmly grounded in dharma.

40
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:09.833
Lord Krishna

41
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.250
assures us

42
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.500
that the very process of devotion

43
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.791
itself brings transformation,

44
00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:18.708
while other spiritual paths may require long

45
00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:19.875
and difficult

46
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:22.916
rituals of atonement.

47
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:25.708
Devotion, through Lord Krishna's devotee

48
00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:26.708
having a continuous

49
00:02:26.708 --> 00:02:30.291
connection, purifies the heart.

50
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:33.416
Even in moments of weakness and despair,

51
00:02:33.416 --> 00:02:34.916
remembering the Lord

52
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:35.791
as the supreme

53
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:39.416
purifier acts.

54
00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:41.875
Lord Krishna's firm declaration –

55
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:44.916
'My devotee never perishes' –

56
00:02:44.916 --> 00:02:47.125
is extremely significant.

57
00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.666
He asks Arjun to declare

58
00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:50.791
this truth,

59
00:02:50.791 --> 00:02:53.458
which is a powerful affirmation of the Lord's

60
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:57.041
unwavering protection of His devotees.

61
00:02:57.041 --> 00:02:57.583
Lord Krishna

62
00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:01.625
by entrusting this promise to Arjun,
of the devotee's words' supreme

63
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:04.583
credibility He highlights.

64
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:06.041
Since Lord Krishna

65
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:08.250
even above His own honour

66
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.375
His devotee's integrity values,

67
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:13.625
therefore this statement, of the Lord

68
00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:15.166
and His devotees

69
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:18.875
reveals the deep mutual bond.

70
00:03:18.875 --> 00:03:20.000
This verse

71
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.250
not only Lord Krishna's

72
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.375
impartiality emphasises,

73
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:25.416
but also toward His devotees

74
00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:28.208
His extraordinary love reveals,

75
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.500
those who are dedicated to Him.

76
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:38.125
You have seen, haven't you,

77
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:41.208
how a diamond covered in dirt,

78
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:41.833
once washed,

79
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:45.416
regains its brilliance.

80
00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:47.166
In the same way, the soul

81
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:50.916
too becomes clouded by straying,

82
00:03:50.916 --> 00:03:53.000
but by devotion's

83
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.375
water is purified again.

84
00:03:56.375 --> 00:04:00.208
When you stumble and make a mistake,

85
00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:04.291
do not drown in the sea of guilt.

86
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:05.666
I

87
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.125
look beyond your mistakes,

88
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:12.000
at the divine potential hidden within you.

89
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.375
What matters is how quickly from your mistakes

90
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:19.250
you recover,

91
00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.958
how soon you correct yourself

92
00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:27.125
and return to the right path.

93
00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:30.750
Mistakes do not define you,

94
00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.708
rather the depth of effort made to learn

95
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:36.750
and improve from them

96
00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.958
reveals the truth of your character.

97
00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:45.250
If you have strayed from the path,

98
00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:49.708
then think with a calm mind

99
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:52.583
What went wrong?

100
00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:56.125
Be tested in the fire of repentance,

101
00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:58.041
but

102
00:04:58.041 --> 00:05:02.625
do not let your self-confidence burn in it.

103
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:04.666
Remember,

104
00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:06.750
the path of dharma

105
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.083
is the path of purification.

106
00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:14.250
It lifts the burden of guilt

107
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:19.041
and reconnects you with the reality of life.

108
00:05:19.041 --> 00:05:23.458
Remember, I am always

109
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:26.666
with you.

110
00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:31.833
Believe in yourself, in your own divinity.

111
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:35.208
Keep faith in your practice.

112
00:05:35.208 --> 00:05:37.500
Peace is certain.

113
00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.000
And remember,

114
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.125
your divine nature

115
00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:44.916
never perishes,

116
00:05:44.916 --> 00:05:48.250
however many veils

117
00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.333
may cover it.

118
00:05:54.291 --> 00:05:56.833
A single drop of water

119
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.250
cannot alone become an ocean,

120
00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.666
but every drop of the ocean

121
00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:07.416
carries the essence of the ocean.

122
00:06:07.416 --> 00:06:09.083
In the same way,

123
00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:11.833
in a family every member,

124
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:14.583
complete in themselves,

125
00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:17.458
represents the whole family.

126
00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:18.750
Guiding the younger

127
00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.625
members of a family

128
00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:23.000
is a serious responsibility.

129
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:27.291
But no parent can at every moment,

130
00:06:27.291 --> 00:06:32.000
in every situation, be with their children.

131
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.875
This is where the importance

132
00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:36.875
of the Lord's teachings emerges.

133
00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:39.958
Helping children from an early age

134
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:42.500
to establish a personal bond

135
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.166
with Me

136
00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:46.875
is extremely important.

137
00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:50.458
This very bond, in life's crises,

138
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:54.083
will become their true shelter.

139
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:55.041
When you

140
00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:58.500
introduce them to divine knowledge

141
00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.833
and with Me a relationship

142
00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:03.833
help them build,

143
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:07.000
then you give them,
far beyond momentary advice,

144
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.041
a much more valuable gift.

145
00:07:10.041 --> 00:07:14.500
They receive such eternal guidance

146
00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.625
that even if

147
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:19.458
they stray from the path of life at some point,

148
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:21.625
My knowledge will bring them back

149
00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:24.208
to the right way.

150
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:26.416
Remember,

151
00:07:26.416 --> 00:07:29.750
My love is boundless

152
00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.208
and without any conditions.

153
00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:37.208
I never abandon those

154
00:07:37.208 --> 00:07:40.541
who take My shelter.

155
00:07:40.541 --> 00:07:42.083
And undoubtedly,

156
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:46.333
this is the greatest assurance for a family.

157
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:50.125
You make Me your children's friend

158
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:53.208
and guide.

159
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.041
Through My stories, My divine pastimes,

160
00:07:56.041 --> 00:08:00.416
and the deep truths of life, in your children

161
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:04.333
awaken love and reverence for Me.

162
00:08:04.333 --> 00:08:06.000
Show them

163
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.250
that I do not reside only in temples, but

164
00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.333
in their hearts too I dwell.

165
00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:20.125
A skilled leader

166
00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:23.791
in his colleagues' mistakes sees

167
00:08:23.791 --> 00:08:30.000
an opportunity for correction and growth.

168
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.500
As an organisation leader, your duty

169
00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.916
is not to justify your colleagues' mistakes,

170
00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:41.333
nor to ignore them,

171
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:44.833
but to bring them onto the right path.

172
00:08:44.833 --> 00:08:47.916
See, mistakes will happen.

173
00:08:47.916 --> 00:08:50.500
This is human nature.

174
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.000
It is from mistakes that a person learns

175
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.041
and can attain excellence.

176
00:08:58.041 --> 00:09:00.541
But what matters is

177
00:09:00.541 --> 00:09:06.625
how you as a leader respond.

178
00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:11.333
Your behaviour is the mirror of your leadership.

179
00:09:11.333 --> 00:09:13.583
Just as I

180
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:17.000
bring My devotees, after straying,

181
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:21.708
back to the path of dharma,

182
00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:22.416
in the same way

183
00:09:22.416 --> 00:09:26.250
you too can your colleagues, with repeated

184
00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.541
training and gentleness,

185
00:09:29.541 --> 00:09:33.333
guide them toward growth.

186
00:09:33.333 --> 00:09:34.750
This guidance

187
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.083
removes their doubts.

188
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:41.083
This does not mean

189
00:09:41.083 --> 00:09:45.208
excusing their wrong actions, but

190
00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:48.500
in their own capacity for growth

191
00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:52.625
building their unwavering belief.

192
00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:54.041
When you

193
00:09:54.041 --> 00:09:57.000
create such an environment

194
00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.708
where learning even from mistakes

195
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.708
is encouraged,

196
00:10:01.708 --> 00:10:05.625
then you, of trust and responsibility,

197
00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:08.958
a growth-driving yet

198
00:10:08.958 --> 00:10:12.625
flexible culture develop.

199
00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:13.708
This culture itself

200
00:10:13.708 --> 00:10:16.583
becomes the foundation
of the organisation's rise.

201
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:18.250
Remember,

202
00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.083
every person holds immense potential

203
00:10:21.083 --> 00:10:24.750
within them, and your skilled guidance

204
00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.916
can bring out the best qualities in them,

205
00:10:28.916 --> 00:10:32.000
and through encouragement alone their abilities

206
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.125
can flourish.

207
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:38.291
Be such an organisation leader

208
00:10:38.291 --> 00:10:41.875
who does not give up, but again

209
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:44.416
shows the path to recovery,

210
00:10:44.416 --> 00:10:46.916
who inspires progress.

211
00:10:46.916 --> 00:10:53.250
Remember, leadership is a continuous practice

212
00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.208
in which recognising

213
00:10:54.208 --> 00:10:57.500
other members' abilities

214
00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:02.416
and nurturing them is the highest dharma.

215
00:11:02.416 --> 00:11:08.250
Adopting the principle of
'karmanyevadhikaraste,'

216
00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:12.791
you, on your path of duty remaining steadfast,

217
00:11:12.791 --> 00:11:16.416
will set the example of true leadership.
